// FIRSTWARD_APPARITION_HAUNT_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3886903977" "I was once like you."
// FIRSTWARD_APPARITION_HAUNT_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3806622011" "The darkness comes for you."

// FIRSTWARD_APPARITION_COAXING_BURNTOUT_SEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2968534156" "There is rest here, Seer.  You will see."
// FIRSTWARD_APPARITION_COAXING_BURNTOUT_SEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
