// FIRSTWARD_APPARITION_COAXING_BURNTOUT_SEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4260455914" "Leave the worries of the world behind.  Join us in rest."
// FIRSTWARD_APPARITION_COAXING_BURNTOUT_SEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3181343168" "Quiet.  Time to sleep, Seer.  Join us."

// FIRSTWARD_APPARITION_COAXING_BURNTOUT_SEER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2647511276" "You will taste darkness!"
// FIRSTWARD_APPARITION_COAXING_BURNTOUT_SEER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
